      "Bash(claude plugin* marketplace*)",
      "Bash(claude plugin* prune*)",
      "Bash(claude plugin* autoremove*)",
      "Bash(claude plugin* tag*)",
      "Bash(claude plugin* uninstall*)",
      "Bash(claude plugin* remove*)",
